;; expect: main.tw refused infix_form
;; §8.4 slice 3.27 landing 4 (docs/LEAN.md): an operator symbol where an argument is expected
;; is Lean's infix habit — `(n + 1)` applies n to + and 1 — refused infix_form with the prefix
;; spelling (+ n 1), where it was function_expected over Nat.
(import Init Nat.add)
(fn tw ((n Nat)) Nat (n + 1))
